      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我想买一副新耳机，主要用来听中文。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你现在的耳机怎么了？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "还能用，但是戴久了不太舒服。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那舒适比很多功能更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我看到有的耳机功能很多，价格也高。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你真的需要那些功能吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "可能不需要。我主要听对话和音乐。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那试试这个比较轻的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "戴起来不错，也没有夹得太紧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "声音清楚吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "很清楚，人声也比较自然。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那就很适合语言学习。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个价格也在我的计划里。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你可以再试五分钟，看看耳朵舒服不舒服。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好。我以前买东西常常只看功能。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "现在你更知道自己需要什么了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc025_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，简单、舒服、声音清楚就够了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
